{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f8f92b5554a9eac7931f4929216f9ed71cd4ed41d0811c4d1c2426d8333376d0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a1c56a1dd107c76133424af62fefc4fa31c93c53753ac364a9e3683ef59d4dc",
      "text": "打扰啦——！\n老师～，找我有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f2ba91af062d15d87f53c614431f0e5defc18c26329904242f4c49d990e7950",
      "text": "若里君。\n今天的课你又睡着了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd5aad468922769daccb845108fbe77d67eeec368d0982c4c98e943da9c6584b",
      "text": "抱歉，抱歉！\n因为打工到早上，一个不小心就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92cbf3f7b20ca616d8a4357e29ae7d4713ea10a9684b232c59442d73104101f9",
      "text": "考试挂科，出席天数也勉勉强强……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d81fb808668cefd4b00d73941f1882e928cdc00c0e18dcab61c89b36cc6e115",
      "text": "你到底要留级多少次才甘心啊？\n再这样下去，下次真的要被退学了哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c0482bdd2a3bff6d5c0e443cabdbe20cea4ef5934c3054a3a25fca0078c7a4",
      "text": "……退学！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ebd5eb204c38285ba24885e7934d8bc74282094e49b23cf8eb6c778fd92de17",
      "text": "没、没有什么挽回的办法吗？\n我会洗心革面的啦！拜托了～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08be97d7e7b6755a7ca4d7abce6ac7f30cff3b39d2a7679dd31ab104b684c90d",
      "text": "这个嘛……\n至少在社团活动里做出点成绩的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad09012561b6d1983ba1ae0df33ef9cbaeb13cd6d4199c969335e66e6baca732",
      "text": "哎呀？\n若里君，你加入了轻音部啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f1a7a6359d1c84f802298a91f08642cf76f32ff7aabcb3bcec0db1f2572e55f",
      "text": "哎？……啊，好像确实加了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85799304f98b8655df68e5a044a3cbc667c6a05f45fd9cd14965dda6243a3e07",
      "text": "比如去参加比赛获奖之类的……\n如果有能得到认可的成绩，应该就能毕业了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4510e66232640d17fc32e3cfaecb6bdfb0b1cb7127ccb39e2181e19e57ffa77a",
      "text": "真的……假的！？太好啦——！\n那我明天就去轻音部看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
